  358:            // Rest bone world matrix is a pure translation to its centroid (rest
  359:            // rotation is identity for this rig), so the bindpose is the inverse
  360:            // translation. world[i]*bindpose[i] == identity at rest → zero shred.
  361:            var bindPoses = new Matrix4x4[boneCount];
